{"reviewId": "14457184_82UQqwVTv", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "疑问：个人的理解，在衰退到萧条的转折点，应该是大宗牛市的顶端，后续应该开启大宗的熊市了吧？然后一直熊到萧条到回升前夕，因为回升阶段理论上应该是对于资源的需求量也要上升了，但是这样一来不是变成了大宗的牛市应该是回升的起点开始了吗？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "10161-10249", "abstract": "在第四次康波中，美国的全要素生产率在1966年附近到达高点，这正是康波繁荣的顶点，在经历了波动之后，全要素生产率的低点出现在1982年，即第四次康波萧条的结束点（见图1-8）。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "14457184_82UQqwVTv", "userVid": 14457184, "topics": [], "createTime": 1756992918, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 14457184, "name": "佳飞猪¹", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/k947icPboBqCf9n1kkG0k09nPZll8NVTc65nxiaxibTZEZtbuCj11TYqOq5PoiawKODMmcFojH3O8ww/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "14457184_82UQqwVTv", "content": "我的理解：大宗牛市主要还是在衰退期阶段，到萧条期走弱，回升期大宗会走强，但是不会太多。主要还是靠技术进步带来的生产力提升。", "commentId": "14457184_82UQqwVTv_c17149084_84BY5OBy9", "userVid": 17149084, "createTime": 1762963966, "author": {"userVid": 17149084, "name": "蛋黄叔", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJQJicUNVQmpcmItjyHMZXYuiaWL8x1nLtlXLZG1P9l1190csntxQJyoOp9HY0L8LlssXzndBZcpERA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "de